| `RAW`                                  |                   Y                   |                    !                     |     N     |     N     |     N     |     N      |     N     |    N     |    N    |    N     |   N    |   N    |      N      |        N        |     N      |    N    |     N      |   N   |   N   |      N       |  Y⁴   |     N     |    N     |
