- SQL Syntax

    ```sql
    COMPILE PLAN [IF NOT EXISTS] <plan_file_path> FOR <insert_statement>|<statement_set>;

    statement_set:
        EXECUTE STATEMENT SET
        BEGIN
        insert_statement;
        ...
        insert_statement;
        END;

    insert_statement:
        <insert_from_select>|<insert_from_values>
