{{< hint info >}}
`COMPILE PLAN` statement supports writing the plan to a remote [filesystem]({{< ref "docs/deployment/filesystems/overview" >}}) scheme like `hdfs://` or `s3://`. 
Please be sure that the target path has set up the write access.
